| Step                | Formula                                                                          | Meaning                      |
| ------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Projection distance | ((WIDTH/2) / (tan(FOV/2)))                                                       | Distance to projection plane |
| Corrected distance  | (dist * cos(ray_angle - player_angle  ) )                                        | Removes fisheye              |
| Column height       | ((TILE_SIZE * proj_plane_dist ) /corrected_dist )                                | Perspective scaling          |
| Start of wall       | ((H /2 ) - (column_height /2))                                                   | Top of slice                 |
| End of wall         | (start + column_height )                                                         | Bottom of slice              |
| Door open amount    | (1 - offset)                                                                     | Fraction visible             |
| Shift upward        | ((column_height * offset) / 2)                                                   | Simulates vertical motion    |


